- Per-tenant KMS CMKs and IAM roles for encryption and access control
- Routing by tenantId from Kinesis to downstream sinks
- Late data handling with replay mechanism and DLQ
- Data cataloging with Glue and query access via Athena
- Auditing with DynamoDB logs and CloudTrail

## Code Example

